---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Enya songs, albums, biography, lyrics, and more!";
const description = "Enya Lyrics is a tribute to singer Enya featuring all her song lyrics, downloads, Only Time info, albums information, videos, biography and more!";
const canonical = "https://www.enyaone.com/";
const ogImage = "https://www.enyaone.com/enya-promo.jpg";
const bodyClass = "";

const schemaJson = {
	"@context": "https://schema.org",
	"@type": "WebPage",
	"name": title,
	"description": description
};
---

<Layout {title} {description} {canonical} {ogImage} {bodyClass} {schemaJson}>

      <div id="holidays2025">
<h2><em>Holidays with Enya</em></h2>
<a href="https://amzn.to/4okO9eR" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"><img src="/ecs.jpg" alt="Christmas Secrets album cover">
<p><em><strong>Christmas Secrets</strong></em><br /> The ultimate compilation</p></a>

<a href="https://amzn.to/43aGdVb" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"><img src="/awc.jpg" alt="And Winter Came album cover">
<p><em><strong>And Winter Came...</strong></em><br /> A winter-themed album</p></a>

<a href="https://amzn.to/4hEQ7nG" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"><img src="/vbe.jpg" alt="The Very Best of Enya album cover">
<p><em><strong>The Very Best of Enya</strong></em><br /> The perfect gift</p></a>
</div>

				<h1>Enya songs, albums, biography...</h1>

				<p class="desc"><strong>Welcome to Enya One!</strong> Explore Enya's <a href="/enya-songs-albums">song lyrics, translations</a>, <a href="/enya-songs-albums">albums</a>, <a href="/enya-video">videos</a>, and <a href="/enya-biography">biography</a>.</p>


	<ul>
		<li><strong>Discography</strong>: Discover all <a href="/enya-songs-albums">songs, albums, and lyrics</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>Biography</strong>: Gain a deeper understanding of <a href="/enya-biography">Enya's career and life</a>.</li>
		<li><strong>FAQs</strong>: Find answers to  <a href="/enya-biography#faq">frequently asked questions</a>.</li>


		<li><strong>Explore the genre</strong>: Discover more <a href="/new-age-music">artists like Enya</a>: New Age, celtic artists with similar ethereal or ambient styles.</li>

				</ul>

				<h2>Even more about Enya:</h2>

				<ul>

					<li><strong>Stream Enya's Music</strong>: Explore a  <a href="/all-enya-songs">complete list of Enya's songs</a> available for streaming and download.</li>


					<li><strong>Creative Collaborators</strong>:  <a href="/roma-ryan-nicky">Roma Ryan and the late Nicky Ryan</a> contributed significantly to Enya's music, writing and producing captivating compositions.</li>


					<li><strong>Family Ties</strong>: <a href="/enya-clannad">Clannad</a> a renowned band formed by Enya's family including Moya Brennan, influenced Enya's musical journey.</li>


					<li><strong>Multimedia:</strong> Watch <a href="/enya-video">music videos and live performances</a>.</li>


				</ul>


				<h2 id="About_Enya">Who is Enya?</h2>

				<a target="_blank" href="https://www.amazon.com/Enya/e/B000APUOQK?ref=sr_ntt_srch_lnk_2&amp;qid=1641169744&amp;sr=1-2&_encoding=UTF8&tag=enylyrallenys-20&linkCode=ur2&linkId=d541620b701d12b789cae68caf79229e&camp=1789&creative=9325"><img src="/enya-home2023-2.jpg" alt="Stream or download Enya songs" class="float-left width-33 rounded"  width="150" height="243" /></a>

				<p><a href="/enya-biography"><strong>Enya</strong></a> is a Grammy Award Irish singer, often labeled as “New Age”. Singing and playing all instruments by herself, she made world hits such as “<a href="/a-day-without-rain#Only_Time">Only Time</a>”, “<a href="/enya-other#May_It_Be">May It
					Be</a>” and “<a href="/watermark#Orinoco_Flow">Orinoco Flow (Sail Away)</a>”.
					<br /> <a href="/enya-biography"><strong>More about Enya &raquo;</strong></a></p>

				<p>Artists like Enya: <a href="/new-age-music">Celtic Woman</a>, <a href="/new-age-music">Clannad</a> (Enya's family band), <a href="/new-age-music">Loreena McKennitt</a>, <a href="/new-age-music">Vangelis</a> and <a href="/new-age-music">Yanni</a>.</p>

</Layout>
